! mcp_bootstrap_p320.strap -- MCP printed page 320: the opening of the
! JOB CONTROL BINARY LOADER (22LOADER): its punch controls and two
! (CC*) header cards, then A LOADR's entry (ALOADR .. the card-type
! branch table at ATYPE), lines 1-54.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.71, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD
! ID TA000001  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 320" (round glyphs in
! numeric fields read 0).  The heading row's LOCATION field is BLANK
! (line 1 is PUNFUL, which prints no location).
!
! THE PAGE.  54 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it.  A "*"
! after the LOCATION on lines 1 (no location), 3, 23 and 46.  No TAIL.
!   line  1      PUNFUL.
!   lines 2-3    two (CC*)DD(BU,,12) cards at 236524.00 and 236534.34
!                (the deck's "B HED, REP, 22LOADER, LOAD,," header card
!                images) -- see below.
!   lines 4-6    PUNORG, PUNID,22LOADER, RESEQ.
!   lines 7-9    remark banner "******** JOB CONTROL BINARY LOADER ****".
!   line  10     SLC,YMPBUF prints 234424.00.
!   lines 11-54  code, contiguous from 234424.00 (ALOADR) to 234456.40
!                (line 54, B, a half word; next location 234457.00),
!                then blank paper.  Lines 26-54 are ATYPE's branch
!                table, indexed by card type (B,ATYPE-.32($3)).
!
! JOIN.  This page opens a new program: its card serials restart at
! TA000001.  Lines 2-3 CONTINUE p.319 (scratch neighbour): p.319's
! YMPBUF DRZ(BU),1088 at 234424.00 leaves its counter at 236524.00,
! line 2's printed location.  Line 10's SLC,YMPBUF then goes BACK to
! 234424.00: the loader's code overlays the buffer p.319 reserved
! ("RESERVE ROOM FOR OVERLAID AREA").  The deck still states 236524.00
! hard (an SLC stand-in).  p.321 (scratch) opens at 234457.00 =
! line 54's next location, contiguous; but its first serial is
! TA000047, and this page's last is TA000045: NO TA000046 is printed
! on either page.  p.321's header prints PUNID 22LOADER, the PUNID set
! by this page's line 5 (this page's header still prints 11D11MCP).
!
! >>> LINES 2-3'S (CC*)DD ARE ASSEMBLED (2026-11-10). <<<
! They used to be comments (their blanks then typed 12 and 30, not
! measured), with two SLC stand-ins at their printed
! locations, because strap_asm refused entry mode CC.  Both assemblers
! now take CC (C28-6129 p.16: each character its card column's
! punches, App. F p.56; the bit order row 12 high is
! ATBL's, printed p.331).  ONE
! stand-in stays: "SLC, (8)236524.00", the counter the page before leaves
! (the JOIN above), since this deck is assembled alone.  It stands
! BEFORE the PUNFUL, so it is not the chart OS "1ST SLC" under PUNFUL.
!
! THE COLUMNS.  Line 2's printed span 236524.00 -> 236534.34 is 540
! bits = 45 twelve-bit characters, and with line 3 the two make
! one 80-column card under PUNFUL.  The blanks are MEASURED in the ink
! (PDF 71 at 300 dpi, the fixed print pitch 29.95 px per cell from the
! statement column): "B" in cell 16, "HED" from cell 25, the "*" in
! cell 61; the second card's name from cell 43.  That is 8 blanks after
! the B and 27 before the name, and it is MCP's control-card form
! (C22-6678-1 pp.7-10): "B" in column 1, "HED, REP, 22LOADER, LOAD,," from
! column 10, the name in columns 73-80 (the ID field; the PUNID,22LOADER after
! PUNORG punches the same ID on the binary cards).  Line 2
! is 45 characters, line 3 35; the card's last 0 column(s)
! are PUNFUL's zero fill.  tests/check_strap2_punch.py A5 reads the
! card back; A7 checks line 3 lands at 236534.34.
!
! NOT LOADED.  PUNFUL punches full cards and the loader cannot load one
! (C28-6129 pp.23, 36), so the loaded image does not hold these bits:
! strap_asm emits them into a scratch image (A6 checks).  STRAP II
! keeps them in its assembly image and punches them as the full card,
! which A1's decoder, like MCP's loader, does not load.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 11 label printed "ALCADR" = ALOADR (open O): C22-6728 "The
!     MCP Loader - ALOADR", "B, ALOADR".
!   * line 11 "ALCR1" and line 22 label "ALCR1" = ALDR1: at 900 dpi the
!     third glyph has a straight left stem (D, worn bowl), unlike the
!     round C of "CM0000" on the same rows.  Same address either way
!     (line 11's BZBZ prints 234436.74, line 22 is 234436.40).  No deck
!     or C22-6728 spells it.
!   * line 29 "B,ACCTAL" = AOCTAL: p.291 line 32's remark "USED IN
!     AOCTAL ROUTINE"; C22-6728 "uses AOCTAL".
!   * line 27 "B,ANCRMR" = ANORMR (C22-6728 "return to ANORMR").
!   * line 54 "B,AFLCW" = AFLOW (C22-6728 "AFLOW, Figure").
!   * line 45 ALDADJ (C22-6728 "handled by ALDADJ").
!   * lines 19-21 "CMOCOO" = CM0000 (connective digits).
!   * line 22 "LVE,$3,C($15)" = 0($15); line 23 "Z,$C" = Z,$0 (prints
!     000020.22, $0's word 16 as Z,ALL on line 12 prints ALL's word .22).
!   * line 25 "B,ATST1": digit 1 (the flagged 1 of "$15" beside it).
!   * hex fields "CO"/"FC"/"8C" = 00 / F0, as the octal fields of the
!     same rows print 0 open.
!   * line 16 prints a raised dot after "ALOWWD" and line 22 a raised
!     dot between the label ALDR1 and LVE: stray ink (not "-", so not
!     the comment mark); not written.
!
! EXTERNALS.  p.291's loader data block (landed) defines ALL, ATCRDI,
! ALDCTR, ALOWWD, AHGHWD, AHIWD, ASEQID: written here in p.291's own
! form at p.291's addresses.  Every other external is defined on a page
! not landed; its value comes from this page's binary, and each comment
! says how much it fixes.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  TA000001 .. TA000045.  Shared serials: lines 24-25
! (TA000024), 27-28 (TA000026), 41-42 (TA000039), 43-44 (TA000040),
! 45-46 (TA000041), 47-48 (TA000042), 49-50 (TA000043), 51-52
! (TA000044), 53-54 (TA000045).  None skipped.  Line 14's serial prints
! a stray "." after it.

YMPBUF  SYN(BU), (8)234424.0         ! p.319 (scratch) line 14 "YMPBUF DRZ(BU),1088" at 234424.00; SLC line 10 prints 234424.00
ALL     SYN(N), (8)232543.0          ! p.291 line 9 "ALL DRZ(N),1" at 232543.00 (landed)
ATCRDI  SYN,ALL.1                    ! p.291 line 10 (landed), 232543.01
ALDCTR  SYN(N), (8)232552.0          ! p.291 line 34 "ALDCTR DRZ(N),1" at 232552.00 (landed)
ALOWWD  SYN(BU,32), (8)232553.0      ! p.291 line 36 DRZ(BU,32),1 at 232553.00 (landed)
AHGHWD  SYN(BU,32), (8)232553.40     ! p.291 line 37 DRZ(BU,32),1 at 232553.40 (landed)
AHIWD   SYN(BU,32), (8)232554.0      ! p.291 line 38 DRZ(BU,32),1 at 232554.00 (landed)
ASEQID  SYN(BU,12), (8)232554.40     ! p.291 line 39 DRZ(BU,12),1 at 232554.40 (landed)
ATST1   SYN, (8)234546.40            ! not landed; B line 25 234546.50, half word only
ANORMR  SYN, (8)235233.0             ! not landed; B line 27 235233.10, half word only
AERR3   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)235221.40   ! not landed; form as p.322 (scratch) writes it; B lines 28-52 235221.50, half word only
AOCTAL  SYN, (8)235034.40            ! not landed; B line 29 235034.50, half word only
ASUPRT  SYN, (8)234600.0             ! not landed; B line 31 234600.10, half word only
APCARD  SYN, (8)235130.0             ! not landed; B line 33 235130.10, half word only
ATCARD  SYN, (8)234576.40            ! not landed; B line 35 234576.50, half word only
ABCARD  SYN, (8)234601.40            ! not landed; B line 37 234601.50, half word only
ADCARD  SYN, (8)235172.0             ! not landed; B line 39 235172.10, half word only
AFPCRD  SYN, (8)234634.0             ! not landed; B lines 41, 43, 51 234634.10, half word only
ALDADJ  SYN, (8)234621.0             ! not landed; B line 45 234621.10, half word only
AXWBIN  SYN, (8)235260.0             ! not landed; LX line 47 235260.10, half word only
ARBNCD  SYN, (8)234653.0             ! not landed; B line 48 234653.10, half word only
AXRDAT  SYN, (8)235261.0             ! not landed; LX line 49 235261.10, half word only
ARBDCD  SYN, (8)234764.0             ! not landed; B line 50 234764.10, half word only
AXWFLW  SYN, (8)235256.0             ! not landed; LX line 53 235256.10, half word only
AFLOW   SYN, (8)234615.0             ! not landed; B line 54 234615.10, half word only

        SLC, (8)236524.0             ! STAND-IN for the counter the page before leaves: this line's printed location -- see header
        PUNFUL                                               ! line  1
        (CC*)DD(BU,,12),B        HED, REP, 22LOADER, LOAD,,          *   ! line  2
        (CC*)DD(BU,,12),                           22LOADER*   ! line  3
        PUNORG                                               ! line  4
        PUNID,22LOADER                                       ! line  5
        RESEQ                                                ! line  6
! -**************************************************************  ! line  7
! -        ******** JOB CONTROL BINARY LOADER ***************        ! line  8
! -**************************************************************  ! line  9
        SLC,YMPBUF                                           ! line 10
ALOADR  BZBZ,.57($15),ALDR1                                  ! line 11  -CHECK IF NEW JOB
        Z,ALL                                                ! line 12  -INITIALIZE LOADER
        BZBZ,.89($15),$+2.                                   ! line 13
        CM1111(BU,1),ATCRDI                                  ! line 14  -SET TO STORE INITIAL ID AND SEQ
        LF(BU,18),.32($15)                                   ! line 15  -SET PPS BOUNDARIES
        SF(BU,18),ALOWWD                                     ! line 16
        LF(BU,18),1.($15)                                    ! line 17
        SF(BU,18),AHGHWD                                     ! line 18
        CM0000,ALDCTR                                        ! line 19  -ZERO BINARY CARD ORIGIN COUNTER
        CM0000,ASEQID                                        ! line 20  -ZERO SEQ AND ID COUNTER
        CM0000,AHIWD                                         ! line 21  -ZERO PROGRAM HIGH WORD
ALDR1   LVE,$3,0($15)                                        ! line 22
        Z,$0                                                 ! line 23
        SIC,$14                                              ! line 24
        B,ATST1                                              ! line 25
ATYPE   B,ATYPE-.32($3)                                      ! line 26  -SEPARATE CARD TYPES
        B,ANORMR                                             ! line 27
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 28  -B CARD
        B,AOCTAL                                             ! line 29  -C CARD
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 30  -ILLEGAL CARD
        B,ASUPRT                                             ! line 31  -SUPER T CARD
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 32  -ILLEGAL CARD
        B,APCARD                                             ! line 33  - P CARD
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 34  -ILLEGAL CARD
        B,ATCARD                                             ! line 35  - T CARD
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 36  -ILLEGAL CARD
        B,ABCARD                                             ! line 37  - BRANCH CARD
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 38  -ILLEGAL CARD
        B,ADCARD                                             ! line 39  -DUMP CARD
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 40  -ILLEGAL CARD
        B,AFPCRD                                             ! line 41
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 42  -FORTRAN PROGRAM CARD
        B,AFPCRD                                             ! line 43
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 44  -COMMON DEFINITION CARD
        B,ALDADJ                                             ! line 45
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 46  -LOADER ADJUSTMENT CARD
        LX,$4,AXWBIN                                         ! line 47
        B,ARBNCD                                             ! line 48  -RELOC. BIN. INSTR. CARD
        LX,$4,AXRDAT                                         ! line 49
        B,ARBDCD                                             ! line 50  -RELOC. BIN DATA CARD
        B,AFPCRD                                             ! line 51
        B,AERR3                                              ! line 52  -FORTRAN BRANCH CARD
        LX,$4,AXWFLW                                         ! line 53
        B,AFLOW                                              ! line 54  -FLOW CARD

!SYM ALOADR 234424.00
!SYM ALDR1  234436.40
!SYM ATYPE  234440.40

!CHECK 234424.00 | 000000.71 8F 234436.74 04 | line 11 ALOADR BZBZ,.57($15),ALDR1 (printed "ALCADR", "ALCR1")
!CHECK 234425.00 | 232543.22 00 | line 12 Z,ALL (hex prints "C0" = 00)
!CHECK 234425.40 | 000001.31 8F 234427.74 04 | line 13 BZBZ,.89($15),$+2.
!CHECK 234426.40 | 232543.01 80 001000.36 F0 | line 14 CM1111(BU,1),ATCRDI
!CHECK 234427.40 | 000000.40 8F 022000.06 70 | line 15 LF(BU,18),.32($15)
!CHECK 234430.40 | 232553.00 80 022000.12 F0 | line 16 SF(BU,18),ALOWWD
!CHECK 234431.40 | 000001.00 8F 022000.06 70 | line 17 LF(BU,18),1.($15)
!CHECK 234432.40 | 232553.40 80 022000.12 F0 | line 18 SF(BU,18),AHGHWD
!CHECK 234433.40 | 232552.00 80 000400.00 F0 | line 19 CM0000,ALDCTR (printed "CMOCOO")
!CHECK 234434.40 | 232554.40 80 014000.00 F0 | line 20 CM0000,ASEQID (printed "CMOCOO")
!CHECK 234435.40 | 232554.00 80 040000.00 F0 | line 21 CM0000,AHIWD (printed "CMOCOO")
!CHECK 234436.40 | 000000.07 BF | line 22 ALDR1 LVE,$3,0($15) (printed "ALCR1", "C($15)")
!CHECK 234437.00 | 000020.22 00 | line 23 Z,$0 (printed "$C")
!CHECK 234437.40 | 000036.00 80 | line 24 SIC,$14
!CHECK 234440.00 | 234546.50 00 | line 25 B,ATST1
!CHECK 234440.40 | 234440.10 03 | line 26 ATYPE B,ATYPE-.32($3)
!CHECK 234441.00 | 235233.10 00 | line 27 B,ANORMR (printed "ANCRMR")
!CHECK 234441.40 | 235221.50 00 | line 28 B,AERR3
!CHECK 234442.00 | 235034.50 00 | line 29 B,AOCTAL (printed "ACCTAL")
